          <input id="earTrainerDegreeInput" class="melodies-interval-input" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[1-7]*" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Note scale degrees" maxlength="3" disabled="">
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-primary ear-trainer-next-btn" id="earTrainerNextBtn" aria-label="Next exercise" title="Next exercise">
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </button>
        </div>
        <p class="ear-trainer-input-hint">
          Example: 1, ♭3, 5. Tap the small button under a box to cycle ♭, ♮, ♯.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="melodies-actions">
        <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-secondary" id="earTrainerPlayBtn">▶ Play notes</button>
        <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-primary" id="earTrainerCheckBtn">Next exercise</button>
      </div>

      <div class="melodies-result" id="earTrainerResult"><strong>Answer revealed</strong><span>C2 ↑ C#2 ↑ D2</span><div class="melodies-answer"><b>Scale degrees</b><div><span>1</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>♭2</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>2</span></div></div><div class="melodies-answer"><b>Intervals</b><div><span>m2</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>m2</span></div></div><small>Listen again and notice the scale degrees. Key C · root C2. Direction is not scored.</small></div>
      <div class="melodies-footer-actions">
        <button type="button" class="melodies-link-btn" id="earTrainerRevealBtn" disabled="">Reveal answer</button>
        <button type="button" class="melodies-link-btn" id="earTrainerNewBtn">New exercise</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <section class="ear-trainer-session" id="earTrainerSession" aria-labelledby="earTrainerSessionHeading">
      <div class="ear-trainer-session-header">
        <h2 id="earTrainerSessionHeading">Today’s session</h2>
        <button type="button" class="melodies-link-btn" id="earTrainerResetSessionBtn">Reset session</button>
      </div>
      <div role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <strong id="earTrainerAccuracy">0% first-try accuracy</strong>
        <span id="earTrainerSessionCount">0 of 2 notes · 1 exercise</span>
      </div>
      <p id="earTrainerSessionHint">Only your first check counts. Revealed notes count as missed; prefilled roots are excluded.</p>
    </section>
  </section>"
`;
